WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.447
Tom wanted to be the new royal wizard.

2
00:00:08.448 --> 00:00:11.530
So did everyone else.

3
00:00:11.531 --> 00:00:15.964
But only one wizard could try out.

4
00:00:15.965 --> 00:00:29.308
"I will pick the best wizard soon," said Master Wizard.

5
00:00:29.309 --> 00:00:38.144
Tom practiced lots of magic spells.

6
00:00:38.145 --> 00:00:45.124
The other wizards practiced too.

7
00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:56.199
One day Master called all the wizards.

8
00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:00.524
"Each wizard must make a gift appear," he said.

9
00:01:00.525 --> 00:01:05.917
"I will pick the best gift—and the best wizard."

10
00:01:05.918 --> 00:01:12.999
Walter laughed. "Tom can't make a gift appear!"

11
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:18.943
Other wizards laughed too.

12
00:01:18.944 --> 00:01:22.299
Tom frowned.

13
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:26.452
Wizards made fancy cakes and candy appear.

14
00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:35.976
Golden coins and pens appeared too.

15
00:01:35.977 --> 00:01:41.223
Then Tom lifted his wand.

16
00:01:41.224 --> 00:01:46.684
"I'll give everyone red socks with dots!"

17
00:01:46.685 --> 00:01:51.270
Poof!

18
00:01:51.271 --> 00:01:55.810
"You fool!" cried Walter.

19
00:01:55.811 --> 00:01:58.914
"You gave us red spots!"

20
00:01:58.915 --> 00:02:14.718
"We all have chicken pox!" said another wizard.

21
00:02:14.719 --> 00:02:21.116
"Everyone is sick but you, Tom," said Master.

22
00:02:21.117 --> 00:02:24.640
"You must go to the palace."

23
00:02:24.641 --> 00:02:30.820
"I will do my best, Master!" said Tom.

24
00:02:30.821 --> 00:02:42.938
Tom got his sack and hurried away.

25
00:02:42.939 --> 00:02:46.690
A minute later he was back.

26
00:02:46.691 --> 00:02:51.246
"Master?" asked Tom.

27
00:02:51.247 --> 00:02:55.882
"Where is the palace?"

28
00:02:55.883 --> 00:03:00.406
Master sighed and gave Tom a map.

29
00:03:00.407 --> 00:03:05.814
"You must go through the Dark Forest," warned Master.

30
00:03:05.815 --> 00:03:09.219
"It is very dangerous.

31
00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:15.180
Make sure you stay on the path!"

32
00:03:15.181 --> 00:03:25.605
Tom took the map and headed for the Dark Forest.

